@pixeltrix I have added two specs covering both scenarios. IMO, it does restore the old behaviour letting user append the attachment to the collection when `replace_on_assign_to_many = false` config is disabled. Ref: https://github.com/rails/rails/pull/42455/files#diff-e346e335288f81186850ba1a547cc88e1009ac51b5194769dfa1cc615aaff75fR777

Also, this resolve the issue regarding duplicating the attachment blobs when Active Storage setter methods(i.e: `association_name=` and `attach`) are used in a combination before transaction is committed.

Sorry if I am failing to understand the comment 😊
